  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nMany of the operations supported by CanvasRenderingContext2D.globalCompositeOperation and the CSS mix-blend-mode property take varying lengths of time to complete depending on the contents of the source and destination images. This allows an attacker to infer the content"
